== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that follows Isaac around and fires chaotic bursts of tears in all directions at random intervals while in a room with enemies, shooting faster the closer it is to an enemy, similarly to {{E|Boil}}s.
** Each tear fired by Boiled Baby does either 3.5 or 5.3 damage, with no in-between.
* {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Boiled Baby having the lowest priority at {{dlcalt|6th|r+=8th}} and thus staying the farthest away from Isaac when compared to other familiars with higher priorities.

== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Boiled Baby|Boiled Baby]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.

